      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining AWS Integration**\n\nI'm starting to build a Python file, `select_platform_resource.py`, to handle provider-specific resources. Currently, I'm focusing on AWS as the external provider. I'm using the 'write' tool to construct the file. This feels like a good starting point.\n\n\n**Choosing AWS Bedrock**\n\nI've decided to proceed with AWS Bedrock as the initial external provider. I'm aiming to include a placeholder for an AWS Bedrock client within `select_platform_resource.py`. The file will also have a function to select an appropriate model. I'll continue using the 'write' tool for this.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862341681,
          "start": 1789862339147
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
